OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785154708
OL,3,CMan arrested on suspicion of two
OL,4,Ccounts of attempted rape in Rochdale
OL,6,FPolice have arrested a man in his 20s
OL,7,Fon suspicion of two counts of
OL,8,Fattempted rape.
OL,10,FGreater Manchester Police received two
OL,11,Freports of sexual assault from victims
OL,12,Fin Rochdale in the early hours of this
OL,13,Fmorning, nearly an hour and a half
OL,14,Fapart.
OL,16,FAt 6.15am, officers received a report
OL,17,Fthat a woman had been sexually
OL,18,Fassaulted in Broadfield Park, and then
OL,19,Fa second report was received of a
OL,20,Fdifferent woman being assaulted in
OL,21,FMilnrow Memorial Park at 8.38am.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/3
