OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785154708
OL,3,CMan arrested on suspicion of two
OL,4,Ccounts of attempted rape in Rochdale
OL,6,FBoth women have said they did not know
OL,7,Fthe man, and provided similar
OL,8,Fdescriptions of the suspect.
OL,10,FDetectives then issued an appeal for a
OL,11,Fsuspect described as a black male
OL,12,Fwearing a three-piece suit or smart
OL,13,Fblack clothes and a dark coat.
OL,15,FThe suspect is also believed to have
OL,16,Fbeen carrying a briefcase.
OL,18,FOfficers identified CCTV footage of a
OL,19,Fman matching that description in the
OL,20,FCoco Lounge in Rochdale, which he was
OL,21,Fseen leaving at around 5am.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/3
