OL,3,CMan arrested on suspicion of two
OL,4,Ccounts of attempted rape in Rochdale
OL,6,FPolice are asking that anyone with
OL,7,Finformation about the case, contact
OL,8,Fthem on 101, quoting incident number
OL,9,F679 and 880 of 25/07/2026, or report
OL,10,Finformation via GMP's LiveChat service.
OL,12,FInformation can also be passed
OL,13,Fanonymously to Crimestoppers on 0800
OL,14,F555 111.
